  lines:
  - 3 Months ago, we discovered signs of life on planet Lingas-249.
  - This discovery could be a breakthrough in our research.
  - It's been almost a month now since our Expedition Team set out to explore the
    planet.
  - We've been in contact the whole time, but this morning we lost their signal.
  - "We put together a rescue team who is on route now to the signal\u2019s last
    known location."
  - It's up to us to find the crew members, and get them back safe.
